      "description": "Returns multiple projects in the specified organization. Each organization can have multiple projects. Use projects to:\n\n- Isolate different environments, such as development, test, or production environments, from each other.\n- Associate different MongoDB Cloud users or teams with different environments, or give different permission to MongoDB Cloud users in different environments.\n- Maintain separate cluster security configurations.\n- Create different alert settings.",
      "operation_id": "getOrgGroups",
      "operation_id_override": null,
      "http_verb": "GET",
      "url": {
        "parts": [
