            "required": false
          },
          {
            "description": "Flag that indicates whether the response body should be in the prettyprint format.",
            "name": "pretty",
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "description": "Organization membership status to filter users by. You can supply this parameter multiple times. Allowed values: `ACTIVE`, `PENDING`, `INVITATION_EXPIRED`, `INVITATION_REJECTED`. If you exclude this parameter, this resource returns ACTIVE and PENDING users. Not supported in deprecated versions.",
