    "listGroupClusters": {
      "description": "Returns the details for all clusters in the specific project to which you have access. Clusters contain a group of hosts that maintain the same data set. The response includes clusters with asymmetrically-sized shards. This feature is not  available for serverless clusters.\n\nThis endpoint can also be used on Flex clusters that were created using the [Create Cluster](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/reference/api-resources-spec/v2/#tag/Clusters/operation/createCluster) endpoint or former M2/M5 clusters that have been migrated to Flex clusters until January 2026. Please use the List Flex Clusters endpoint for Flex clusters instead.",
