    "restartGroupClusterPrimaries": {
      "description": "Starts a failover test for the specified cluster in the specified project. Clusters contain a group of hosts that maintain the same data set. A failover test checks how MongoDB Cloud handles the failure of the cluster's primary node. During the test, MongoDB Cloud shuts down the primary node and elects a new primary.",
